{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">61歲的曾華倩自淡出幕前後，生活一直保持低調，但間中仍會在社交平台分享近況，與大家保持互動。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日前，曾華倩上載了一張與張國強（KK）的溫馨合照。這對昔日經典兒童節目《430穿梭機》的「元祖級」主持激罕合體，瞬間勾起大批網民的集體回憶。相中可見，KK親密地搭着華倩膊頭，二人頭貼頭對着鏡頭展露燦爛笑容，足見縱使歲月流逝，兩人的深厚友誼依然不減當年，畫面相當溫馨。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"401f685d-bea1-4ac0-a4ff-42699d5e6479.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026dyeYRhGKOl1790933200.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"401f685d-bea1-4ac0-a4ff-42699d5e6479.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了分享舊友重逢的喜悅，曾華倩近日更剪了一頭短髮改換新造型。她戴上型格太陽眼鏡對着鏡頭自信甜笑，並開心發文寫道：「新造型！頭髮剪短了！把肥嘟嘟的手腳弄漂亮了！」可見她現時的生活相當開心愜意。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6a5ceeb7-b765-4d8b-8495-25ba701cbdda.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026iZ2zyvuczg1790933199.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6a5ceeb7-b765-4d8b-8495-25ba701cbdda.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"96662d48-1dbb-42e1-8952-6d5cdcaca343.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026kvxPCJHN8n1790933199.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"96662d48-1dbb-42e1-8952-6d5cdcaca343.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T13:38:47.113503+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}